# NaMiOS — goi ho tro DEMO bo go tieng Viet (fcitx5 + Unikey): yeu cau
# Cuong 10/11/2026 "anh chup that bo go tieng Viet" duoi QEMU tu dong.
#
# xdotool: gia lap go ban phim (XTEST) de hook 0500 TU DONG go thu mot cau
# tieng Viet kieu Telex vao trinh soan thao luc dang nhap lan dau, phuc vu
# chup man hinh — khong dung de dieu khien may nguoi dung thuc.
#
# Trinh soan thao de go thu: kiem lai package-lists hien co cho thay
# `kate` DA duoc 0100-desktop-kde.list.chroot keo vao (goi kem KDE), nen
# KHONG them `kwrite` o day nua (hook 0500 se uu tien goi kwrite neu co,
# tu dong rot ve kate vi kate chac chan co san).
#
# verified_on_host: NO — ten goi `xdotool` la ten chuan/on dinh nhieu doi
# Debian, nhung van PHAI xac nhan bang `apt-cache show xdotool` tren build
# host Debian 13 trixie thuc truoc khi build (ADR 0002 spike), khong suy ra
# tu lich su cac ban Debian truoc.

xdotool
